# FlintTrade — design-system

Read `packages/core/design-system/CLAUDE.md` first. This package owns shared FlintTrade UI primitives, tokens, motion utilities, and brand assets consumed by terminal and site.

## Rules
- Keep exports explicit in `package.json`; do not leak terminal-only widgets or Dockview code.
- Preserve Tailwind v4 `@source` compatibility for both consuming apps.
- Prefer shadcn/ui-compatible primitives and `lucide-react` icons.
- Keep chart wrappers app-private; share only token/theme primitives here.
- Update the visual regression baseline plan when token or component behaviour changes.
